, so inbound and outbound run on the same platform. Inbound and outbound both run on the same usage-based pricing.0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","script",null,{"id":"article-json-ld","type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],["$","script",null,{"id":"breadcrumb-json-ld","type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fwww.artisan.co\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Blog\",\"item\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fwww.artisan.co\\u002Fblog\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"The best LeadIQ alternatives in 2026\",\"item\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fwww.artisan.co\\u002Fblog\\u002Fthe-best-leadiq-alternatives\"}]}"}}],["$","$L3",null,{"post":{"id":"4SiL9dVQVZ9Moio7yb0IiR","slug":"the-best-leadiq-alternatives","title":"The best LeadIQ alternatives in 2026","metaTitle":"The best LeadIQ alternatives in 2026","publishedDate":"2026-07-30","seoDescription":"The best LeadIQ alternatives in 2026, compared on data quality, capture workflow, pricing, and how much of the outbound job each tool actually runs.","readTime":"11 minutes","tag":"Sales","keyTakeAways":{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"kyprwggh4muz"}},"id":"nNBJhLzUxy30iycUXMOgj","type":"Entry","createdAt":"2026-07-30T12:48:26.628Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-30T12:48:26.628Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":1,"revision":1,"contentType":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"ContentType","id":"blogKeyTakeaways"}},"locale":"en-US"},"fields":{"keyTakeAways":{"keyTakeAways":["Artisan is the top LeadIQ alternative when you want the capture-to-meeting motion in one system: over 250M B2B professionals, over 250M local businesses, waterfall enrichm